        "original_id": "4ef74496-2dc5-52b0-89bf-5270717ac1f3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Pork Soda, Dr. Martens footwear\n- People: Hank Williams Jr., Cher, Jerry Garcia, Jimi Hendrix, James Brown\n- Organizations: Costco\n- Creative Works: Pink Floyd, the Residents, Macbeth, Bottom, Ren & Stimpy\n- Concepts: pop culture references, footwear design features\n\nFacts:\n- The album Pork Soda includes pop culture references to Hank Williams Jr., Cher, Pink Floyd, the Residents, Jerry Garcia, Jimi Hendrix, James Brown, Macbeth, Costco, Dr. Martens, Bottom, and Ren & Stimpy.\n- Dr. Martens footwear is distinguished by an air-cushioned sole called \"Bouncing Soles,\" a particular upper shape, welted construction, and yellow stitching.",
